      "expected": "The specification states PR1 is excluded from the board and not wired: 'the r2 netlist shows PR1 with on_board: no, in_bom: yes, and all four pins (VCC, SDA, SCL, GND) typed free — i.e., it is not connected to any net in this design' (§4.3, §6). The intended water-level sensor is the ultrasonic HC-SR04 read on two ESP32 GPIOs (§1, §4.4): 'the water-level sensing that is actually wired and actually used by firmware is an HC-SR04-style ultrasonic sensor read on two ESP32 GPIOs'.",
